# GitHub Actions CI

This repo runs Playwright on push/PR via `.github/workflows/playwright.yml`.

## Keep the workflow honest

- Install with `npm ci`, then `npx playwright install --with-deps`, then `npx playwright test`.
- Do not add `test.only` / `test.skip` that would hide failures. Config already sets `forbidOnly` on CI.
- Do not weaken CI by skipping browsers or ignoring failures unless the user asked.
- Keep the HTML report upload (`playwright-report/`, `if: ${{ !cancelled() }}`).

## When changing CI

- Prefer the existing Node LTS setup. Do not pin a random Node version without a reason.
- Timeouts belong in `playwright.config.ts` or the job `timeout-minutes`, not `sleep` steps.
- Secrets in workflows use `${{ secrets.NAME }}` only.
- Change the workflow only when the user asked for CI work. Do not "improve" it as a side effect of a test change.
